        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2005-02-06/05-04#art_104>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2005-02-06/05-04#art_110>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2005-02-06/05-04#art_129>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2005-02-06/05-04#art_130>,
